# This is the first ever katipo website!

Katipo is an http alternative for creating, sharing, hosting, browsing and using apps, games, and websites.

# Examples

The most polished example is [Solitaire](link = "katipobrowser.com/solitaire"), which can be played on either desktop keyboard/mouse or on a touch screen device. Refresh the page to try again with cmd-R or using the refresh button in the bottom left.

This is [Snake](link = "katipobrowser.com/snake"). You need arrow keys on a keyboard to play at the moment. Turn the sound on!

This is [Blockout](link = "katipobrowser.com/blockout"). Use the arrow keys, or you can play on a touch screen by touching the left side of the screen to move left or the right to move right. Turn the sound on!

And this is a demo of [Waraki](link = "katipobrowser.com/waraki"). Waraki is an mp3 player, and I recorded a mini podcast as an example. You can host your own music library too.

More coming soon!